# Achieving True Power at Prog 1: the battlefield won, then its 32001 finished after a GM clears the local var
# battlefieldWin (`localvar battlefieldWin 0`): the quest's 32001 handler's other side: nothing (still accepted, no
# scroll).
lists NavukgoExecutionChamber/_1s0/onTrade NavukgoExecutionChamber/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=NavukgoExecutionChamber pos=-598.5,8,-100 job=PUP lvl=75
levelcap 75
quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues completed
quest Bastok.AchievingTruePower accepted
charvar Quest[1][85]Prog 1
item PuppetmastersTestimony
login
trade _1s0 PuppetmastersTestimony x1  # Prog 1: the battlefield's 32000 menu
update 32000 option=49               # index 3, area 1: registered, entered
finish                               # in the arena
kill SHAMARHAAN                      # area 1: won (his death alone ends it), battlefieldWin 1123, 32001 opens
localvar battlefieldWin 0            # GM: the win's local var cleared
finish                               # 32001, battlefieldWin 0: nothing
